{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>近日好評如潮的Grok Bot 突被大幅降用量，引起用戶不滿。相反，越來越進取的 Muse from Meta 就提供很大用量給用戶，但暫時未對香港／台灣開放，只提供 Waiting List。本文簡單快速教大家如何突破限制，跨區申請 Muse 帳戶，並提供 10 億枚 Muse 代幣領取方法。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d6d7320d7322511d4e343e1b6fb70e28e688baa607f5b20822cc2962f119aadd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fcb059c130e825e5bd9b689747319510d\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>簡單流程</h2><p>要在不支援 Muse 的地區申請帳戶，可以用 VPN 連到美國，然後用瀏覽器以 E-mail 申請（不下載 App 也可）。雖然申請要用 VPN，但開戶後就不用再連住 VPN，在大多數地區自由使用。</p><h2>Muse 申請攻略</h2><p>1：首先，連接 VPN 到美國（近日 <a href=\"https://go.nordvpn.net/aff_c?offer_id=15&amp;aff_id=11236\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NordVPN</a> / <a href=\"https://billing.purevpn.com/aff.php?aff=41724\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PureVPN</a> 也推出 Black Friday 優惠，可考慮）。</p><p></p><p>2：用電腦瀏覽器申請會較簡單，因為要正式開放的地區 App Store /Google Play帳號（如美國）才可下載 App，因此我們要用 Browser 申請，<a href=\"https://muse.ai/join\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">開啟 Meta AI 申請頁面</a><a href=\"https://muse.ai/join\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://muse.ai/join</a>。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"651\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cba6751f4b97b84375311663ed577728c20e834a622ca574901591ea1bcb8bdc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F4edb978bfd407931b4ba99fe1bff480a\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>3：最重要步驟是「千萬不要登入」 Meta 帳號！要用 E-mail 來申請！</p><p>4：輸入 E-mail 代碼以註冊。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"761\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5110e7fe6c29809122f604283ac92ce817feabc8ef7ce894b82f70535dcb73c9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fd768a79ad68718c516262bf73d95fbd2\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>5：接著輸入出生日期，要成年才可用。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"541\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4157f4db7fa8aa9a7b0a37bf435f2233bd32e38ed85be7a470fb108318c37406/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F23fac29299a634f180a7c5e4dc5fe776\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>6：看到須知事項後按「開始使用」。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"821\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a7d21691f12a211a66cb7b59169257bd3eeb0c45a1612cfeebecc4d249fc76e3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fa0f8c999d1d50b0d6e631d4ef1138fc7\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>領取 10 億枚 Muse 代幣</h2><p>1：先到 Muse 的左下方選單進入設定。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"643\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ad06b3578f1722f83a87d9784f6dd9de450938ad637befdbd1a8203e7e54eb47/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F013328388685557e14793f482beaaa15\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>2：在設定的「一般」選「兌換邀請代碼」，只要輸入 <strong>D7W1WO</strong> 就可以拿到！</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"737\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/75a17bc1544efda05aa0b8dfb650ff40ab950a138b9c152d3f4443e4963d2a38/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F0f2bb8f1a7548cde038d3deb35562aa3\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1018\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/79e28c4ff8bd0cfd362e878d6212c405cb59453dffd6e66a2a52d199e85a80cf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F28967436433dc7ea47247a5151bfcb80\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>兌換碼：<br/>D7W1WO</p><h2>下載 Muse 手機 App</h2><p>由於 Muse from Meta 只是對部份地區開放，所以香港／台灣等地區的 App Store 是不能下載 App，不過換成美國 App Store 帳戶<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/muse-from-meta/id6760173601\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">即可下載</a>。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2087\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fac20efc6d5aaf5ec3a0d573bf3241df6171a0df6b60ad2ffcc665d09048f19e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F1f991d1195b80bde82f57e2c0ba45e61\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>初時可叫 Muse 做什麼任務？</h2><p>最簡單就是叫它管理你的 E-mail，這樣它可從中認識你，了解你的需要！你之後更可連結你的 Meta 各項服務，成為你的全方助手。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"786\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/29dea64d54f7959aa3d58311d7046fbd2ee910afb34c9c9a9801efa0206e0783/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F593d9a2d9bb83db8f910f3264e9971ce\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.742743+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":819,"images":10,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:21.359270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:35.828976+00:00","content_hash":"8e7cf1d0068bf9faf466d2dcf93c2e46d2017396a3d6f7e805e9a56b8be7f48b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}